2. 对照 [main.cpp:L449-L454](https://github.com/chili-chips-ba/wireguard-fpga/blob/9887a3b39a1bb6aff9642f3a21ea4a8863f3dfaf/2.sw/app/main.cpp#L449-L454)，把 `192.168.0.0` 手工打包成 `uip`：`(192<<24)|(168<<16)|(0<<8)|0 = 0xC0A80000`。
